with all the things

00:38:33.013 --> 00:38:37.116
that we find as we
keep the site up,

00:38:37.116 --> 00:38:39.240
hopefully how are we going
to be doing the backups?

00:38:39.240 --> 00:38:41.781
How are we going to be creating
policies ourselves to keep it

00:38:41.781 --> 00:38:42.540
